OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy but some clearer periods
OL,7,Fallowing the odd mist and fog patch to
OL,8,Fform, more especially toward the east.
OL,9,FWinds remaining mainly light. Mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloud giving a few showers in
OL,12,Fplaces through the morning but
OL,13,Fgenerally drier and brighter into the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Feeling warm or very warm
OL,15,Fwith a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
